## Interface: 120100,120007
## Title: MindCollector Arena Log
## Notes: Turns combat logging on when an arena starts and off when it ends, so WoWCombatLog.txt holds your games and nothing else.
## Author: MindCollector
## Version: 1.0
## SavedVariables: MindCollectorArenaLogDB

# Two versions on purpose. The client this was installed against is 12.1.0.69933 (tocversion
# 120100); 120007 is kept alongside it so the addon still loads on a 12.0.7 client rather than
# silently not loading on one of them.
#
# A STALE INTERFACE LINE FAILS SILENTLY — no error, no slash command, while the addon still shows
# ticked in the AddOn List, and "Load out of date AddOns" does not reliably override it. That is
# what happened to MindCollectorExport in 2026-08 when its line still read 110107. If /mcarenalog
# does nothing after a reload, suspect this line first: run /dump GetBuildInfo() in-game and add
# the fourth return value (tocversion) to the front of the list.

main.lua
